       - **Similarity threshold:** Any remaining candidate with similarity ≥0.70 that meets any of the above must be SELECTED.
    4. **Guaranteed pick.**  
       If any candidate has similarity ≥0.85, select it without further checks.
    5. **No false negatives.**  
